ENTRY            G0105   20260701   20261124   20261124       G061
SUBENT        G0105001   20260701   20261124   20261124       G061
BIB                 13         20
TITLE      Studies of some isomeric yield ratios produced with
            bremsstrahlung
AUTHOR     (D.Kolev)
INSTITUTE  (3BULSOF)
REFERENCE  (J,ARI,49,989,1998)
FACILITY   (BETAT,3BULBUL) Medical Academy of Bulgaria
INC-SOURCE (BRST)
SAMPLE     Targets were powder samples (<0.5 g) in PVC capsules
            (10 mm diameter, 0.5 mm thickness), wrapped in
            1 mm Cd foil, and placed in a 6 mm plexiglass
            container.
DETECTOR   (GELI) The activity was measured using high-resolution
            gamma-spectrometers with FWHM <3 keV at 1.332 MeV
            Co line and 3-6% photopeak efficiency.
METHOD     (ACTIV) Irradiation duration varied from 12 to 30 min
            with the bremsstrahlung beam kept constant.
ANALYSIS   (DECAY)
STATUS     (TABLE,,D.Kolev,J,ARI,49,989,1998) Table 1 and 2
ERR-ANALYS (DATA-ERR) No information on sources of uncertainties.
HISTORY    (20260701C) VT
ENDBIB              20
COMMON               1          3
EN-MAX
MEV
        43.
ENDCOMMON            3
ENDSUBENT           27
